"recipe_id":"20 Homemade Custard Ice Cream",
"source_text":"Recipe text（整理后的流程文字）:\n1. 将 2 个鸡蛋的蛋清和蛋黄分离，只取蛋黄。\n2. 蛋黄中加入 40g 糖和几滴去籽柠檬汁，用电动打蛋器打约 1–2 分钟，至颜色变成淡黄色。\n3. 将 50g 牛奶倒入锅中，边搅拌边加热至微微冒泡，约 80°C。\n4. 将热牛奶迅速倒入蛋黄液，同时快速搅拌，防止蛋黄受热结块。\n5. 将蛋奶液倒回锅中，加入少量盐，边搅拌边加热至微微冒泡，然后放凉。\n6. 将 200g 淡奶油打发至约九分发，形成小尖角。\n7. 将冷却后的蛋奶液加入打发的淡奶油中，搅拌均匀。\n8. 倒入容器，立即放入冰箱冷冻；如果制作其他口味，可以在最后混合阶段加入相应配料。\nEnglish process:\nseparate egg yolks → add sugar and lemon juice → whip until pale → heat milk to about 80°C → add hot milk to yolk mixture → whisk rapidly → return custard mixture to pot → add salt → heat and stir until slightly bubbling → cool → whip heavy cream to stiff peaks → combine whipped cream with custard → mix → transfer to container → freeze → finish",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "将 2 个鸡蛋的蛋清和蛋黄分离，只取蛋黄", "text_en": "Separate the whites and yolks of 2 eggs, keeping only the yolks.", "start_char": 26, "end_char": 46, "node_indices": [1, 2, 3], "edge_indices": [1, 2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 2, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "蛋黄中加入 40g 糖", "text_en": "Add 40 g of sugar to the egg yolks.", "start_char": 51, "end_char": 62, "node_indices": [2, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 3, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "蛋黄中加入 40g 糖和几滴去籽柠檬汁", "text_en": "Add a few drops of seedless lemon juice to the egg yolks along with the 40 g of sugar.", "start_char": 51, "end_char": 70, "node_indices": [2, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 4, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "用电动打蛋器打约 1–2 分钟，至颜色变成淡黄色", "text_en": "Beat with an electric whisk for about 1–2 minutes, until the mixture turns pale yellow.", "start_char": 71, "end_char": 95, "node_indices": [2, 6], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 5, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "将 50g 牛奶倒入锅中", "text_en": "Pour 50 g of milk into a pot.", "start_char": 100, "end_char": 112, "node_indices": [7, 8], "edge_indices": [6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "边搅拌", "text_en": "Stir the milk while heating it.", "start_char": 113, "end_char": 116, "node_indices": [8, 9], "edge_indices": [7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 7, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 7, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "边加热至微微冒泡，约 80°C", "text_en": "Heat the milk until it bubbles slightly, to about 80°C.", "start_char": 116, "end_char": 131, "node_indices": [9, 10], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 8, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 8, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "将热牛奶迅速倒入蛋黄液", "text_en": "Quickly pour the hot milk into the beaten egg-yolk mixture.", "start_char": 137, "end_char": 148, "node_indices": [6, 10], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 9, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 9, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "同时快速搅拌，防止蛋黄受热结块", "text_en": "At the same time, stir rapidly to prevent the yolks from forming lumps when heated.", "start_char": 149, "end_char": 164, "node_indices": [6, 11], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "将蛋奶液倒回锅中", "text_en": "Pour the egg-and-milk mixture back into the pot.", "start_char": 170, "end_char": 179, "node_indices": [11, 12], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 11, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "加入少量盐", "text_en": "Add a little salt.", "start_char": 179, "end_char": 184, "node_indices": [12, 13], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 12, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 12, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "边搅拌", "text_en": "Stir the custard mixture while heating it.", "start_char": 185, "end_char": 188, "node_indices": [12, 14], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 13, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "边加热至微微冒泡", "text_en": "Heat the custard mixture until it bubbles slightly.", "start_char": 188, "end_char": 196, "node_indices": [14, 15], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 14, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 14, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "然后放凉", "text_en": "Then let the custard mixture cool.", "start_char": 197, "end_char": 201, "node_indices": [15, 16], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 15, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "将 200g 淡奶油打发至约九分发，形成小尖角", "text_en": "Whip 200 g of heavy cream to about nine-tenths whipped, until it forms small peaks.", "start_char": 207, "end_char": 230, "node_indices": [17, 18], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 16, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 16, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "将冷却后的蛋奶液加入打发的淡奶油中", "text_en": "Add the cooled custard mixture to the whipped cream.", "start_char": 236, "end_char": 254, "node_indices": [16, 18], "edge_indices": [17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 17, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 17, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir until evenly combined.", "start_char": 255, "end_char": 259, "node_indices": [18, 19], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S018", "text": "倒入容器", "text_en": "Pour the mixture into a container.", "start_char": 264, "end_char": 268, "node_indices": [], "edge_indices": [], "node_action_pairs": []}, {"id": "S019", "text": "立即放入冰箱冷冻", "text_en": "Immediately put the mixture in the freezer to freeze.", "start_char": 269, "end_char": 278, "node_indices": [19, 20], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [